---
/* Home "For clients" section, carried over from the legacy page. The full list is on /services. */
---
<section id="services" data-section="" data-bg="rings" aria-labelledby="services-title" style="padding-block: var(--section-y);">
    <div class="cory-container" style="display: grid; gap: var(--space-10);">
      <div data-reveal="" style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-6); flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div style="display: grid; gap: var(--space-3);">
          <p class="cory-overline" style="margin: 0px;"><span class="sc-interp">What I offer</span></p>
          <h2 id="services-title" style="margin: 0px; max-inline-size: 24ch; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-extrabold); font-size: var(--text-fluid-title); line-height: var(--leading-snug); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tighter); color: var(--text-strong); text-wrap: balance;"><span class="sc-interp">Three things I can do for your team</span></h2>
        </div>
        <a data-link="" href="/services" hreflang="en" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); min-block-size: var(--tap-target); font-size: var(--text-body-md); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); color: var(--text-link); text-decoration: none;"><span class="sc-interp">See services</span><svg data-dir-icon="" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div data-cq=""><div data-reveal-group="" data-cq-3="" style="display: grid; gap: var(--grid-gap);">
        <div style="display: grid;"><div class="sc-host-x" style="display: contents;"><div style="background: var(--surface-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: var(--space-6); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; transition: box-shadow var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out), transform var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out);"><div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--blue-100); color: var(--blue-600); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg></div><h3 style="font-size: var(--text-h4); font-weight: var(--weight-bold); color: var(--text-strong); margin: 0px;">AI Product Design</h3><p style="font-size: var(--text-ui); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); margin: 0px;"><span class="sc-interp">From model capability to a flow people trust: prompts, states, guardrails and the UI around them.</span></p><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 2px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: var(--text-overline); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); color: var(--text-subtle);"><span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan-500);"></span>Prompt and state design</span><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: var(--text-overline); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); color: var(--text-subtle);"><span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan-500);"></span>Guardrails</span><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: var(--text-overline); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); color: var(--text-subtle);"><span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan-500);"></span>Evaluation loops</span></div></div></div></div>
        <div style="display: grid;"><div class="sc-host-x" style="display: contents;"><div style="background: var(--surface-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: var(--space-6); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; transition: box-shadow var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out), transform var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out);"><div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--blue-100); color: var(--blue-600); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg></div><h3 style="font-size: var(--text-h4); font-weight: var(--weight-bold); color: var(--text-strong); margin: 0px;">Design System Build</h3><p style="font-size: var(--text-ui); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); margin: 0px;"><span class="sc-interp">Tokens, accessible components and docs your engineers and AI agents can both consume.</span></p><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 2px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: var(--text-overline); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); color: var(--text-subtle);"><span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan-500);"></span>Tokens</span><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: var(--text-overline); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); color: var(--text-subtle);"><span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan-500);"></span>WCAG 2.2 components</span><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: var(--text-overline); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); color: var(--text-subtle);"><span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan-500);"></span>Spec files</span></div></div></div></div>
        <div style="display: grid;"><div class="sc-host-x" style="display: contents;"><div style="background: var(--surface-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: var(--space-6); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; transition: box-shadow var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out), transform var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out);"><div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--blue-100); color: var(--blue-600); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><path d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path><path d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><path d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"></path><path d="m16 16-1.9-1.9"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="3"></circle></svg></div><h3 style="font-size: var(--text-h4); font-weight: var(--weight-bold); color: var(--text-strong); margin: 0px;">UX Audit and Redesign</h3><p style="font-size: var(--text-ui); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); margin: 0px;"><span class="sc-interp">A measured teardown against UX laws and WCAG 2.2, then the redesign that moves the number.</span></p><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 2px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: var(--text-overline); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); color: var(--text-subtle);"><span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan-500);"></span>UX laws</span><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: var(--text-overline); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); color: var(--text-subtle);"><span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan-500);"></span>Accessibility</span><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: var(--text-overline); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); color: var(--text-subtle);"><span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan-500);"></span>Conversion</span></div></div></div></div>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
